{"title":"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems\">2002 AMC 12A #6</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 10A Problems\">2002 AMC 10A #4</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For how many positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> does there exist at least one positive integer n such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/9/8c9c763888b3a336cb7bb4459690907fb04723ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m \\cdot n \\le m + n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"113\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/0/5105ffb4da125ba937310e452301e83cc2ba8142.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 4\\qquad \\textbf{(B) } 6\\qquad \\textbf{(C) } 9\\qquad \\textbf{(D) } 12\\qquad \\textbf{(E) } \\text{infinitely many}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"465\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For any <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> we can pick <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/9/1d96ecc15129c5631ba4a2c6578e91e3d13e3baf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/a/5ba9e88661faca0d503d40e4449e04003a70dddf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m \\cdot 1 \\le m + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"108\" height=\"14\" />,\ntherefore the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/0/bf0b0fd23f978009af82a62e230d862c2188758b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) } \\text{infinitely many}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"156\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Another solution, slightly similar to this first one would be using <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Simon%27s_Favorite_Factoring_Trick\" title=\"Simon&#39;s Favorite Factoring Trick\">Simon's Favorite Factoring Trick</a>.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/5/4053463db6f0aac4428cbd8e5467cbeb2768873e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(m-1)(n-1) \\leq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"150\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/9/1d96ecc15129c5631ba4a2c6578e91e3d13e3baf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, then\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/2/b924335f9fc6fb9e4d4cc3d6d45cdfe81c6fb0a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 \\leq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>This means that there are infinitely many numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> that can satisfy the inequality. So the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/0/bf0b0fd23f978009af82a62e230d862c2188758b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) } \\text{infinitely many}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"156\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If we subtract <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> from both sides of the equation, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/2/41208b67beecd66f5ac90c19e6c41e7fa1cbcf5f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m \\cdot n - n \\le m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"113\" height=\"14\" />. Factor the left side to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/f/8bf1b74209ad9df4db3a730f6d6f52be6ea5a304.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(m - 1)(n) \\le m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"126\" height=\"18\" />. Divide both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/e/d3e872b1716e55bea35303b2aa0c42770b1da5ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(m-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"60\" height=\"18\" /> and we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/5/e8503ae26625e88140e6ee55ae00ae30a99cd7f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\le \\frac {m}{m-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"84\" height=\"33\" />. The fraction <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/4/f64eb74c8a0cc388ad3453b846224cd601daa4d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac {m}{m-1} &gt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"83\" height=\"33\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/c/1cce1bd621aff652b0983cbc94a24545e5f4bdcb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m &gt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"48\" height=\"12\" />. There is an infinite amount of integers greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, therefore the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/0/bf0b0fd23f978009af82a62e230d862c2188758b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) } \\text{infinitely many}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"156\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/fo4oSDca-6c\">https://youtu.be/fo4oSDca-6c</a>\n</p><p>~Thesmartgreekmathdude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A\">2002 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Pro